}
2. Owner sees pending bookings:
GET http://localhost:5000/api/booking/owner
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <owner_token>
3. Owner approves:
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/booking/status/<booking_id>
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <owner_token>
Body:
{
  "status": "approved"
}
4. User checks their bookings:
GET http://localhost:5000/api/booking/mine
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <user_token>

🧠 Full Flow Summary
User books → pending
     ↓
Fraud check passes? → saved to DB
     ↓
Owner sees request → approves/rejects
     ↓
If approved → slots -1, saved to History
     ↓
User sees status updated ✅






















