🧠 How All AI Features Connect
User searches parking
      ↓
Each parking shows → 🟢 Likely Available / 🔴 Likely Full
      ↓
User checks peak hours → Best time to book
      ↓
User books → Fraud check runs automatically
      ↓
User chats → Bot gives smart suggestions